{
  "name": "Shadow Mode",
  "description": "Full Sonic<->Shadow identity swap in creatures.GDA. Creature 0 (the starting character) becomes Shadow in name, 3D model, stats, progression curve, POW moves and movement abilities; creature 4 becomes Sonic. Story recruitment then handles itself by symmetry - where Chapter 4 normally grants Shadow it now grants Sonic, so no plot-flag editing is needed. Dialogue portrait prefixes (columns 17/18) are deliberately NOT swapped: the engine derives portrait names from a prefix plus an expression suffix, and the two characters share only 3 of ~10 expressions, so swapping them corrupts conversation art in both directions. Structural columns (id, playerid, class) are also left alone so party slots stay intact.",
